                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi ariomkuluphira Jesu akala chitu chimwenga chiroho na chimaazo. Takuna hata mmwenga yehenda malize zikale zakpwe macheye, ela ahumira vitu vyao vyosi phamwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara mitume kala achitangaza kufufuka kpwa Jesu na uwezo munji sana, na osi Mlungu achiajaliya sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna yeyesi yephungukirwa ni chitu. Kpwa mana hara ariokala na minda ama nyumba aguza na pesaze achizirehera mitume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mitume kala ana uwezo wa hizo pesa, nao kala achiaganyira ario na shida, kulengana na shida ya mutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
